  "review": "<h2 id=\"intro\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【9月特集】9月に北海道へ行くならここは外せない！秋の味覚と絶景温泉宿10選</h2>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-6\">さわやかな秋風が吹き抜ける9月の北海道は、ひと足早い紅葉と秋の味覚、澄み渡る空が広がる絶好の旅行シーズン！今回は9月に北海道を訪れるなら絶対に外せない、絶景露天風呂と最高級の味覚を誇る名湯宿10選を厳選紹介します。</p>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50/50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 mb-2\">🍁 9月の旅行で絶対に外せない3つのポイント</h3>\n  <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-xs text-stone-800 font-medium\">\n    <li>一足早い鮮やかな紅葉美と澄み切った秋空のパノラマ絶景</li>\n    <li>秋の味覚（山形牛、但馬牛、飛騨牛、松葉ガニ、金目鯛、採れたて地野菜）の旬を堪能</li>\n    <li>冷え込み始める季節に身も心もじんわり温まる絶景露天風呂巡り</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"selection\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 my-8\">厳選10選！おすすめ絶景温泉宿・名門旅館</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1選</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">プチホテル　まほろば</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.90</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-5/12\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/14588/14588.jpg\" alt=\"プチホテル　まほろば\" class=\"w-full h-44 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-100 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-7/12 space-y-2.5 text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">\n      <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/70 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-100/60\">💡 登別温泉の日本最大級露天風呂＆4種の源泉と豪華三大ガニバイキング</